:name: LiteX VexRiscv bare-metal
:description: rv32im bare-metal hello on Renode's LiteX/VexRiscv SoC.
$elf?=$ex_out/litex/litex_hello.elf
using sysbus
mach create "litex"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/litex_vexriscv.repl
showAnalyzer uart
macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
"""
runMacro $reset
